Z||000000||SCCA FIERO||12-04-2001||04:46 PM||||I have a 333 AMD, and it's too slow for these new games. I just bought one that requirese a 350, but says a 650 or higher is recommended. I loaded the game and it won't even work. The game is called Empire Earth.<P>So I called around and got a price of about $220 for a new motherboard and a 1ghz. AMD Athlon. I will probably get a new video card as well for a bit more.<P>Is this a descent price?<P>Another place quoted a new motherboard and an AMD @ 1ghz. for $360.<P>I also called another place and they said they will most likely have to replace everything inside anyway, so I should get a new system (1.4ghz. AMD, 32 meg Geforce II video, and I think he said 128 megs of RAM @ 133. Win. XP, CD ROM, not DVD, and a 20 gig HD) for $998.<P>My current system is a 333 AMD K6/2 3D with 96 megs of RAM @ 100 (was going to upgrade that, but I don't think it will do it). Just a 4 gig HD and an 8 meg video card.<BR>||||reg||1
